eme","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme#metadata","content":"| Entity        | Get-method table             | Join                                         |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| Jetton master | `getmethods.get_jetton_data` | `get_jetton_data.url = nft.url_metadata.url` |","table":"table-0"},"964":{"id":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme-84","page_id":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme#metadata","content":"| Entity         | Get-method table                 | Join                                             |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| NFT collection | `getmethods.get_collection_data` | `get_collection_data.url = nft.url_metadata.url` |","table":"table-0"},"965":{"id":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme-85","page_id":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme#metadata","content":"| Entity   | Get-method table          | Join                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| NFT item | `getmethods.get_nft_data` | `get_nft_data.url = nft.url_metadata.url` |","table":"table-0"},"966":{"id":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme-86","page_id":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/analytics/scheme#metadata","content":"`url` is either the off-chain content URL, or a synthetic `onchain://<type>/<raw_address>` value\n(e.g. `onchain://jetton/0:b113a994…`) for on-chain / semi-chain content. The `metadata` jsonb column\nholds the merged TEP-64 fields: `name`, `symbol`, `decimals`, `image`, `description`, etc."},"967":{"id":"/tonconsole/invoices","page_id":"/tonconsole/invoices","type":"page","content":"GRAM Payment tracker","breadcrumbs":["Tonconsole","TON Console"],"tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/invoic