ontent":"**Payments exceeding the required amount**  \nThe `overpayment` field will represent the difference between the amount paid and the invoice's required amount."},"1031":{"id":"/tonconsole/invoices-63","page_id":"/tonconsole/invoices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/invoices#overpayment","content":"Since Tonconsole focuses solely on tracking transactions and does not process payments directly, handling refunds or adjustments for overpayments will need to be managed on your side. To address such cases, you can use the access credentials to your account holding the funds to implement the necessary refund mechanisms."},"1032":{"id":"/tonconsole/invoices-64","page_id":"/tonconsole/invoices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/invoices#overpayment","content":"This approach ensures you retain full control over your funds while Tonconsole provides reliable real-time monitoring and reporting capabilities."},"1033":{"id":"/tonconsole/invoices-65","page_id":"/tonconsole/invoices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/invoices#tonconsole-ui-features","content":"**Manual Invoice Creation** *(Use the form to create invoices manually)*"},"1034":{"id":"/tonconsole/invoices-66","page_id":"/tonconsole/invoices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/invoices#tonconsole-ui-features","content":"**Invoice Management** *(View and manage invoices in the table)*"},"1035":{"id":"/tonconsole/invoices-67","page_id":"/tonconsole/invoices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/invoices#tonconsole-ui-features","content":"**Statistics** *(Analyze invoice data using built-in statistics tools)*"},"1036":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop","type":"page","content":"Jetton Airdrop Technical and Commercial Terms (T&C Terms)","breadcrumbs":["Tonconsole","TON Console","Jettons","Airdrop"],"tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop"},"1037":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop-0","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop","type":