n on behalf of any Organisation, You represent and warrant that You have all necessary capacity and authority to enter into these Airdrop Terms of Use on behalf of such Organisation as a legally binding contract between such Organisation and Us in all applicable jurisdictions and that the Organisation enters into such contract."},"1161":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-20","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","content":"We may update these Airdrop Terms of Use, T&C Terms, Ton Console terms of use, our Privacy Policy and any of the policies or other documents referred to in them from time to time by notifying You by any other reasonable means. Such updates shall take effect within 10 days after details of them are updated (or, if earlier, of You otherwise being notified of the update). Please check our website (https://tonconsole.com/) regularly for details of updates. If You do not agree to any such update, You should stop using the Airdrop Solution and Airdrop Data (as defined below) before the update takes effect."},"1162":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-21","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#airdrop-solution-and-how-we-work-with-airdrop-admins","content":"The Airdrop Solution allows the issuers / distributors (such issuer/distributor referred as **Airdrop admin**) to distribute their jettons (in these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms “jetton” refers to all types of tokens, irrespective of their nature) in accordance with the terms and conditions established by such Airdrop admins and regulating the participation of end users (**Recipients**) in the Airdrop admin’s airdrop program (**Airdrop**). The Airdrop Solution can be accessed at https://tonconsole.com/. The Airdrop Solution is intended to be used as an interface between: (a) our platform built on a blockchain system offered or operated by Us from time to time whether accessed via the internet, mobile device or other electronic device (Platform); and (b) the applications or services provided by You through Your software and cloud services (Application)."},"1163":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-22","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#airdrop-solution-and-how-we-work-with-airdrop-admins","content":"As part of use of the Airdrop Solution, You may access or otherwise use on Our Platform certain content, including software or other content, materials or data made available via Airdrop Solution  \n(**Airdrop Data**) and technical and commercial terms available at https://docs.tonconsole.com/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop (**T&C Terms**)."},"1164":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-23","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#these-airdrop-terms-of-use","content":"The main things that We care about are that each of Our Platform, the rights of the Recipients and our rights during provision of the Airdrop Solution is protected."},"1165":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-24","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#these-airdrop-terms-of-use","content":"These Airdrop Terms of Use along with the T&C Terms set out Our and Your respective rights and obligations relating to the use of Our Airdrop Solution to interface between Our Platform and Your Application and use of the Airdrop Data."},"1166":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-25","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#these-airdrop-terms-of-use","content":"Your use of any of Our other products or services on Our Platform (**Other Products**) will be on different terms and conditions. If, and only so far as, these Airdrop Terms of Use and the T&C Terms are inconsistent with the terms and conditions applicable to Other Products, such other terms and conditions shall apply."},"1167":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-26","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#these-airdrop-terms-of-use","content":"If these Airdrop Terms of Use or T&C Terms do not specifically say that You can do something in connection with the Airdrop Solution, the Airdrop Data or the Platform, then You cannot."},"1168":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-27","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#these-airdrop-terms-of-use","content":"**We may add, modify or discontinue any feature, functionality or any other tool within Airdrop Solution from time to time at Our own discretion and without further notice to You. The Airdrop admin will have to confirm and check all the terms before the creation of the Airdrop.**"},"1169":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-28","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#access-to-the-airdrop-solution","content":"You agree that the Recipients shall not be prompted to provide any passwords, usernames or other login details that they use to access the Platform directly to You."},"1170":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-29","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#access-to-the-airdrop-solution","content":"**How You may use the Airdrop Solution**"},"1171":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-30","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#access-to-the-airdrop-solution","content":"You must ensure that Your use of the Airdrop Solution complies with:"},"1172":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-31","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],