s, You will fully reimburse Us for any losses on a ‘£’ for ‘£’ basis, without Us having to take steps to avoid or minimise Our loss or to prove this is direct or foreseeable."},"1271":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-130","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#updates-to-the-airdrop-solution","content":"We may make changes to the Airdrop Solution at any time and for any reason. You shall always check the latest version of these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms before launching an Airdrop Program. If any change We make is not acceptable to You, stop using the Airdrop Solution. Your continued use of the Airdrop Solution means that You accept the change to the Airdrop Solution."},"1272":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-131","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#termination","content":"If You breach these Airdrop Terms of Use and/or T&C Terms, Your rights to use the Airdrop Solution and the Airdrop Data will automatically terminate, and We can shut down or restrict Your access to the Airdrop Solution, the Airdrop Data and/or Your API integration."},"1273":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-132","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#termination","content":"Otherwise, the licences granted by Us under these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms will continue until We terminate Your use (which we may do at any time for any reason and without notice) or You stop using the Airdrop Solution, Airdrop Data and the Platform."},"1274":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-133","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#termination","content":"In the event that any of the licences granted by Us under these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms terminate for any reason, You shall promptly permanently delete and destroy all copies of the Airdrop Solution and/or the Airdrop Data in Your possession or control."},"1275":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-134","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#termination","content":"Your obligations relating to the Airdrop Solution, Airdrop Data, data protection, security and confidentiality and the indemnities and licences granted by You and the limitations and exclusions of liability set out in these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms and any other provisions expressed or implied to survive will continue even after any licences (and/or these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms) have otherwise ended for any reason."},"1276":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-135","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#other","content":"Nothing in these Airdrop Terms of Use or T&C Terms shall (except as expressly provided) be deemed to constitute a partnership, or create a relationship of principal and agent between You and Us for any purpose."},"1277":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-136","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#other","content":"You are only permitted to allow a third party to benefit from the Airdrop Solution (such as a related company of Yours or Your customers) if You ensure that such use:"},"1278":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-137","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#other","content":"does not exceed Your permitted use under these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms;"},"1279":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-138","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#other","content":"is controlled by You;"},"1280":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-139","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#other","content":"does not involve the disclosure of any Confidential Information or Airdrop Data (other than in accordance with the terms of these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms); and"},"1281":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-140","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#other","content":"is otherwise subject to and in accordance with these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms."},"1282":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-141","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#governing-law-and-jurisdiction","content":"These Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms and any dispute or claim arising out of, or in connection with, these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms, their subject matter or formation (including non-contractual disputes or claims) shall be governed by, and construed in accordance with, the laws of England and Wales and subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales."},"1283":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-142","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#governing-law-and-jurisdiction","content":"Both parties shall first resolve any dispute or claim arising out of or relating to the Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms by way of negotiation failing which mediation, to any mutually agreed to mediation service for mediation by providing to the mediation service a joint, written request for mediation, setting forth the subject of the dispute and the relief requested (**Mediation**). The parties shall cooperate with one another in selecting a mediation service and shall cooperate with the Mediation service and with one another in selecting a neutral mediator and in scheduling the Mediation proceedings. The parties covenant that they will use commercially reasonable efforts in participating in the Mediation. The parties agree that the mediator’s fees and expenses and the costs incidental to the Mediation will be shared equally between the parties."},"1284":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-143","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#governing-law-and-jurisdiction","content":"The parties further agree that all offers, promises, conduct, and statements, whether oral or written, made in the course of the Mediation by any of the parties, their agents, employees, experts, and legal advisors, and by the mediator and any employees of the mediation service, are confidential, privileged, and inadmissible for any purpose, including impeachment, in any litigation, arbitration or other proceeding involving the parties, provided that evidence that is otherwise admissible or discoverable shall not be rendered inadmissible or non-discoverable as a result of its use in the Mediation."},"1285":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms-144","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/airdrop/terms#governing-law-and-jurisdiction","content":"If the parties cannot resolve any dispute under these Airdrop Terms of Use and T&C Terms, for any reason, including, but not limited to, the failure of either party to agree to enter into mediation or agree to any settlement proposed by the mediator within 20 business days after the first date of the mediation, either party may make a claim in accordance with this clause and subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales."},"1286":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending","type":"page","content":"Mass Jetton Sending","breadcrumbs":["Tonconsole","TON Console","Jettons"],"tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending"},"1287":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending-0","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending","content":"A convenient integrated service for mass sending Jettons to multiple recipients."},"1288":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending-1","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending","content":"This service is currently under development and will be available soon"},"1289":{"id":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending-2","page_id":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/jettons/mass-sending","content":"If you need this service right now, you can contact our support bot."},"1290":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","type":"page","content":"Compressed NFTs (cNFTs)","breadcrumbs":["Tonconsole","TON Console","NFT"],"tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft"},"1291":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-0","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft#cnft-indexing-service","content":"cNFT Indexing Service"},"1292":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-1","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","content":"Compressed NFTs (cNFTs) are a format that allows for the creation of massive collections (up to one billion NFTs) without significant time and $TON costs typically associated with minting. The cNFT format combines two types of storage:"},"1293":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-2","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","content":"**On-chain:** Data is stored directly on the blockchain, making it visible and accessible to all network participants."},"1294":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-3","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","content":"**Off-chain:** Data is stored on a secure server (e.g., Amazon), which enables faster and more efficient operations with NFTs since they do not require direct blockchain processing."},"1295":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-4","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","content":"Minting (registering on the blockchain) of a cNFT occurs upon the first interaction with the digital item. At this moment, the cNFT becomes indistinguishable from a regular NFT, as the digital item is added to the blockchain, making it visible and exchangeable. The cost of registering a cNFT on the blockchain is equivalent to the cost of minting a regular NFT, which is a small symbolic fee."},"1296":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-5","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","content":"For technical implementation details on how to create and manage cNFTs, please refer to:"},"1297":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-6","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","content":"**Compressed NFT Smart Contract::** This repository provides the smart contract required for working with cNFTs on the TON blockchain and includes all necessary documentation to get started."},"1298":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-7","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft#cnft-indexing-service","content":"The cNFT Indexing Service allows you to add and index your cNFTs via the Tonconsole interface, making them available through TonAPI without requiring immediate on-chain minting."},"1299":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-8","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft#cnft-indexing-service","content":"**Tonconsole Interface:** Enables the addition and indexing of cNFTs, making them searchable and accessible across all applications that use TonAPI, including Tonviewer and Keeper, without needing to mint them on-chain until the first interaction."},"1300":{"id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft-9","page_id":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/nft/cnft#cnft-indexing-service","content":"For more information on how to index your cNFTs using Tonconsole, please refer to the relevant documentation and console usage guides."},"1301":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","type":"page","content":"Push Notifications for Decentralized Apps","breadcrumbs":["Tonconsole","TON Console"],"tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages"},"1302":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-0","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#about","content":"About"},"1303":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-1","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#connect-your-dapp","content":"Connect Your Dapp"},"1304":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-2","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#steps","content":"Steps"},"1305":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-3","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#push-notifications","content":"Push Notifications"},"1306":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-4","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#example","content":"Example"},"1307":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-5","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#about","content":"Keeper Messages is a powerful tool for communicating with the users who already connected their wallets to your app using TonConnect. It’s easy-to-use and flexible: you can significantly increase the user retention and conversion rate for your decentralized applications. Keeper Messages is designed like a convenient and trusted way to message the highly motivated audience of Keeper."},"1308":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-6","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#about","content":"It’s best for:"},"1309":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-7","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#about","content":"Marketing campaigns."},"1310":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-8","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#about","content":"Announcements."},"1311":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-9","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#about","content":"Event reminders."},"1312":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-10","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#about","content":"App and account updates."},"1313":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-11","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#connect-your-dapp","content":"To connect a decentralized app to your project, you need to register and verify it. One project can have only one connected app to prevent scam. You will need to create a new project to connect another app."},"1314":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-12","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#steps","content":"Go to Keeper Messages."},"1315":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-13","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#steps","content":"Enter a TonConnect manifest URL or an app URL to register your app. About TonConnect. About TonConnect Manifest."},"1316":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-14","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#steps","content":"Click Register."},"1317":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-15","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#steps","content":"Create a `tc-verify.json` file."},"1318":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-16","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#steps","content":"Copy the payload key and paste it into the `tc-verify.json` file."},"1319":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-17","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#steps","content":"Make the `tc-verify.json` file available at the link specified under the payload key in Keeper Messages."},"1320":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-18","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#steps","content":"Click Verify."},"1321":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-19","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#push-notifications","content":"To start messaging users, you need to refill the number of messages available to you. The Keeper Messages tab displays the number of available messages on the right side of the screen. Click Refill if you need more of them. If your TonConsole balance is low, you will be asked to refill it."},"1322":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-20","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#push-notifications","content":"Pass the token into the header every time you send a request to message users. **The token is secret, don’t reveal it to any third party. If your token was compromised, generate a new one.**"},"1323":{"id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages-21","page_id":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonconsole/tonkeeper-messages#example","content":"`-H ' Authorization: Bearer **YOUR TOKEN**'`"},"1324":{"