,"page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#dapp","content":"DApp"},"1345":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-16","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#ton-connect","content":"TON Connect"},"1346":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-17","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#standard-reference","content":"Standard Reference"},"1347":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-18","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#example-workflows","content":"Example Workflows"},"1348":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-19","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#external-deep-links","content":"External Deep Links"},"1349":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-20","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#tonhub","content":"**Tonhub**"},"1350":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-21","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#example-workflows-1","content":"Example Workflows"},"1351":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-22","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","content":"Your application might operate outside of Keeper, like a website or a mobile app. Deep links allow you to seamlessly direct users back to a meaningful location within the Keeper app."},"1352":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-23","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#deep-linking-into-keeper","content":"Use the supported URI schemes and HTTPS links to deep link into a user's Keeper client on the following platforms:"},"1353":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-24","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#deep-linking-into-keeper","content":"**Mobile clients**:"},"1354":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-25","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#deep-linking-into-keeper","content":"iPhone"},"1355":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-26","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#deep-linking-into-keeper","content":"Android"},"1356":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-27","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uri-schemes","content":"Keeper supports multiple URI schemes, allowing for flexibility depending on the context in which the link is used. The following schemes are supported:"},"1357":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-28","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uri-schemes","content":"**`ton://`**: This scheme is part of the broader TON blockchain standard, enabling interoperability across different TON-based wallets and services."},"1358":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-29","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uri-schemes","content":"**`keeper://`**: The custom URI scheme for deep linking into the Keeper app."},"1359":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-30","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uri-schemes","content":"**`https://app.keeperwallet.com/`**: An HTTPS prefix that can be used in browsers and other environments that do not support custom URI schemes."},"1360":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-31","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uri-schemes","content":"**`tonkeeper://` (legacy)**: The previous custom URI scheme, retained for compatibility with existing integrations."},"1361":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-32","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uri-schemes","content":"**`https://app.tonkeeper.com/` (legacy)**: The previous HTTPS prefix, retained for compatibility with existing integrations. It supports the same paths and parameters as `https://app.keeperwallet.com/`."},"1362":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-33","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uri-schemes","content":"Use `keeper://` or `https://app.keeperwallet.com/` for new Keeper integrations. The previous `tonkeeper://` and `https://app.tonkeeper.com/` prefixes are legacy aliases and remain compatible."},"1363":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-34","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uri-schemes","content":"These prefixes are interchangeable and serve similar purposes, directing users to specific actions or pages within Keeper."},"1364":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-35","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#supported-uris","content":"For each supported action, the structure of the URI is the same across the supported prefixes. Replace `{PREFIX}` with `ton://`, `keeper://`, `https://app.keeperwallet.com/`, or the legacy `tonkeeper://` and `https://app.tonkeeper.com/` prefixes, unless an action specifies a narrower set of prefixes. Keep the action path and query parameters unchanged."},"1365":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-36","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"**Description:** Opens the pre-filled Send screen and prompts the user to enter the missing data."},"1366":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-37","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"**Format:**"},"1367":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-38","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"**Parameters:**"},"1368":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-39","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"`{ADDRESS}` (required): The recipient's TON address."},"1369":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-40","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"`amount` (optional): The amount of GRAM to send, in nanocoins."},"1370":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-41","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"`text` (optional): A URL-encoded UTF-8 text message to attach to the transfer."},"1371":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-42","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"**Examples:**"},"1372":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-43","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"**Address only:**"},"1373":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-44","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"**Address + Amount:**"},"1374":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-45","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"**Address + Text:**"},"1375":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-46","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#1-open-transfer-screen","content":"**Address + Amount + Text:**"},"1376":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-47","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#2-address-with-binary-payload","content":"**Description:** Opens the emulation screen or screen with alert about blind signing transactions with amount and destionation. This can be done using `https://app.keeperwallet.com/`, `keeper://`, or the legacy `https://app.tonkeeper.com/` and `tonkeeper://` prefixes."},"1377":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-48","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#2-address-with-binary-payload","content":"**Format:**"},"1378":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-49","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#2-address-with-binary-payload","content":"**Parameters:**"},"1379":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-50","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#2-address-with-binary-payload","content":"`{ADDRESS}` (required): The recipient's TON address."},"1380":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-51","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#2-address-with-binary-payload","content":"`bin` (optional): url-encoded base64 BoC which will be attached as a body to internal message."},"1381":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-52","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#2-address-with-binary-payload","content":"`amount` (requered if bin is presented): The amount of GRAM to send, in nanocoins."},"1382":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-53","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#3-expiry-timestamp","content":"**Description:** Opens the Send screen with an expiry timestamp for the transaction."},"1383":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-54","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#3-expiry-timestamp","content":"**Format:**"},"1384":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-55","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking#3-expiry-timestamp","content":"**Parameters:**"},"1385":{"id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking-56","page_id":"/tonkeeper/deep-linking","tags":[],"type":"te